so how will the entire flow be?

00:14:07.400 --> 00:14:11.400
so here I have pasted the plan

00:14:11.400 --> 00:14:15.400
so first of all, your start node

00:14:15.400 --> 00:14:19.400
will be your task

00:14:19.400 --> 00:14:23.400
