in the tracker file

00:16:55.400 --> 00:16:59.400
I am giving an example plan, it will not be executed like this

00:16:59.400 --> 00:17:03.400
just I am giving you an example, the scores are saved in the tracker file

00:17:03.400 --> 00:17:07.400
fifth will come to

00:17:07.400 --> 00:17:11.400
read the tracker

